   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Groups",
   "texto": [
    "**Двое, трое, четверо** count groups of people: **двое детей** (two children), **трое друзей** (three friends), **четверо студентов** (four students). With these numbers the noun goes in plural genius."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Both, both of you.",
   "texto": [
    "**Оба** is used with masculine and neutral; **обе** is used with feminine: **оба брата**, **оба окна**, **обе сестры**. In nominee, the name goes in singular genius.",
    "In other cases they change both forms: **с обоими братьями**, **с обеими сёстрами**. **двое, трое, четверо** collectives are used with certain groups of people and plurals; they do not replace all cardinals."
   ]
